# MO-010: Conductivity can change with temperature at fixed salt inventory
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 20C
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 volume
inspect v1
heat v1 10kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 volume
inspect v1
cool v1 10kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 volume
inspect
